    "inconsistent-config-details-contract": {
      "statement": "The OpenAPI server group schemas carry an inconsistentConfigDetails object on the create request and on the read response, whose members are arrays of name and reason entries, one array for each related object type such as serverGroup, appConnectorGroup and idp, and the request schema does not mark it read-only.",
